#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:9
#| msgid "Why Lulaworks"
msgid "What is Lulaworks?"
msgstr "Wat is Lulaworks?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:9
msgid ""
"Lulaworks is an all-in-one platform for contractors — quotations, jobs, "
"tasks, procurement, suppliers, delivery notes, invoices and payments — with "
"AI that handles the tedious data entry. It replaces the spreadsheets, "
"WhatsApp threads and disconnected tools most contractors juggle."
msgstr "Lulaworks is 'n alles-in-een platform vir kontrakteurs — kwotasies, werke, take, verkryging, verskaffers, afleweringsnotas, fakture en betalings — met KI wat die vervelige data-invoer hanteer. Dit vervang die sigblaaie, WhatsApp-drade en ontkoppelde gereedskap waarmee die meeste kontrakteurs goël."

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:10
#| msgid "Why Lulaworks"
msgid "Who is Lulaworks for?"
msgstr "Vir wie is Lulaworks?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:10
msgid ""
"Contractors, engineering firms, mining contractors, maintenance teams, "
"industrial service providers and construction businesses — from a two-person "
"office to a fifty-person operation."
msgstr "Kontrakteurs, ingenieursfirmas, mynkontrakteurs, instandhoudingspanne, industriële diensverskaffers en konstruksiebesighede — van 'n tweeman-kantoor tot 'n vyftig-persoon-bedryf."

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:11
msgid "Do I need to install anything?"
msgstr "Moet ek enigiets installeer?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:11
msgid ""
"No. Lulaworks runs in your browser and on mobile. There's nothing to install "
"and updates happen automatically."
msgstr "Nee. Lulaworks loop in jou blaaier en op mobiel. Daar is niks om te installeer nie en opdaterings gebeur outomaties."

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:14
#| msgid "New to Lulaworks?"
msgid "How much does Lulaworks cost?"
msgstr "Hoeveel kos Lulaworks?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:14
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Three plans: Starter (R299/month), Professional (R1,299/month) and Business "
"(R3,999/month). Annual billing saves roughly two months. See the <a "
"href=\"%(pricing_url)s\">pricing page</a> for full details."
msgstr "Drie planne: Starter (R299/maand), Professional (R1,299/maand) en Business (R3,999/maand). Jaarlikse fakturering bespaar ongeveer twee maande. Sien die <a href=\"%(pricing_url)s\">prysbladsy</a> vir volle besonderhede."

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:15
msgid "What's the difference between users and employees?"
msgstr "Wat is die verskil tussen gebruikers en werknemers?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:15
msgid ""
"A <strong>user</strong> is someone who logs in (owner, admin, project "
"manager, procurement, accounts) and consumes a licence. An <strong>employee</"
"strong> is a worker you manage in the system (technicians, drivers, welders, "
"operators). Employees are unlimited on every plan — we never charge for the "
"size of your crew."
msgstr "'n <strong>gebruiker</strong> is iemand wat aanmeld (eienaar, admin, projekbestuurder, verkryging, rekeninge) en 'n lisensie verbruik. 'n <strong>werknemer</strong> is 'n werker wat jy in die stelsel bestuur (tegnici, bestuurders, sweisers, operateurs). Werknemers is onbeperk op elke plan — ons hef nooit vir die grootte van jou span nie."

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:16
msgid "Can I change plans later?"
msgstr "Kan ek later van plan verander?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:16
msgid ""
"Yes. Upgrade any time and the new limits apply immediately. Downgrades keep "
"all your data — you simply can't add users beyond the smaller plan's limit "
"until you're within it."
msgstr "Ja. Gradeer enige tyd op en die nuwe perke geld onmiddellik. Afgraderings behou al jou data — jy kan net nie gebruikers byvoeg bo die kleiner plan se perk totdat jy daarbinne is nie."

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:18 apps/marketing/views.py:130
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Sekuriteit"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:19
msgid "Is my data secure?"
msgstr "Is my data veilig?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:19
msgid ""
"Yes. Lulaworks uses role-based access control, full audit logging and strict "
"tenant isolation, so your company's data is only ever visible to your "
"company. Data is encrypted in transit."
msgstr "Ja. Lulaworks gebruik rolgebaseerde toegangsbeheer, volledige ouditlogging en streng huurder-isolasie, sodat jou maatskappy se data net vir jou maatskappy sigbaar is. Data word tydens vervoer geënkripteer."

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:20
msgid "Who can see my company's information?"
msgstr "Wie kan my maatskappy se inligting sien?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:20
msgid ""
"Only the users you invite, according to the roles you assign them. No other "
"company on the platform can access your data."
msgstr "Slegs die gebruikers wat jy nooi, volgens die rolle wat jy hulle toeken. Geen ander maatskappy op die platform kan by jou data kom nie."

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:22
msgid "AI"
msgstr "KI"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:23
msgid "What does the AI actually do?"
msgstr "Wat doen die KI eintlik?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:23
msgid ""
"It reads documents for you — RFQs, purchase orders, supplier invoices and "
"scopes of work — and fills in the details, and it can suggest quotations "
"based on your own history. Each AI operation uses one AI credit."
msgstr "Dit lees dokumente vir jou — RFQ's, bestellings, verskafferfakture en werkomvange — en vul die besonderhede in, en dit kan kwotasies voorstel gebaseer op jou eie geskiedenis. Elke KI-bewerking gebruik een KI-krediet."

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:24
msgid "What happens if I run out of AI credits?"
msgstr "Wat gebeur as ek nie meer KI-krediete het nie?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:24
#| msgid ""
#| "Non-AI features keep working. Buy a credit pack below or upgrade your "
#| "plan to resume AI document extraction and suggestions."
msgid ""
"All non-AI features keep working normally. You can buy an AI credit pack or "
"upgrade your plan to resume AI operations. Your remaining credits are always "
"shown on your dashboard."
msgstr "Alle nie-KI-kenmerke werk normaal aan. Jy kan 'n KI-kredietpak koop of jou plan opgradeer om KI-bewerkings te hervat. Jou oorblywende krediete word altyd op jou kontroleskerm gewys."

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:26
#: apps/web/templates/web/billing.html:3
msgid "Billing"
msgstr "Fakturering"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:27
msgid "How does billing work?"
msgstr "Hoe werk fakturering?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:27
msgid ""
"You're billed monthly or annually for your chosen plan. AI credits reset "
"each billing cycle. You can buy additional credit packs at any time, and "
"they're added to your balance immediately."
msgstr "Jy word maandeliks of jaarliks vir jou gekose plan gefaktureer. KI-krediete stel elke faktureringsiklus terug. Jy kan enige tyd bykomende kredietpakke koop, en hulle word onmiddellik by jou saldo gevoeg."

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:28
msgid "Do you offer annual billing?"
msgstr "Bied julle jaarlikse fakturering aan?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:28
msgid ""
"Yes — annual billing is available on every plan and saves you roughly two "
"months compared to paying monthly."
msgstr "Ja — jaarlikse fakturering is op elke plan beskikbaar en bespaar jou ongeveer twee maande vergeleke met maandelikse betaling."

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:30
#| msgid "Help & Support"
msgid "Support"
msgstr "Ondersteuning"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:31
msgid "What support is included?"
msgstr "Watter ondersteuning is ingesluit?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:31
msgid ""
"Starter includes email support, Professional includes priority support, and "
"Business includes highest-priority support. You can always reach us at "
"support@lulaworks.com."
msgstr "Starter sluit e-posondersteuning in, Professional sluit prioriteitsondersteuning in, en Business sluit hoogste-prioriteit-ondersteuning in. Jy kan ons altyd by support@lulaworks.com bereik."

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:33
msgid "Data"
msgstr "Data"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:34
msgid "Who owns the data I put into Lulaworks?"
msgstr "Wie besit die data wat ek in Lulaworks sit?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:34
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You do. Your data is yours — we process it to provide the service and never "
"sell it. See our <a href=\"%(privacy_url)s\">Privacy Policy</a>."
msgstr "Jy. Jou data is joune — ons verwerk dit om die diens te lewer en verkoop dit nooit nie. Sien ons <a href=\"%(privacy_url)s\">Privaatheidsbeleid</a>."

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:35
msgid "Can I export my data?"
msgstr "Kan ek my data uitvoer?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:35
msgid ""
"Yes. Quotations, invoices and delivery notes export as PDF, and data exports "
"as Excel."
msgstr "Ja. Kwotasies, fakture en afleweringsnotas voer as PDF uit, en data voer as Excel uit."

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:37
msgid "Trial"
msgstr "Proeftydperk"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:38
msgid "How does the free trial work?"
msgstr "Hoe werk die gratis proeftydperk?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:38
msgid ""
"Every new company gets a 30-day free trial with Professional features, 2 "
"users, unlimited employees, 100 AI credits and 2 GB of storage. No credit "
"card is required to start."
msgstr "Elke nuwe maatskappy kry 'n gratis proeftydperk van 30 dae met Professional-kenmerke, 2 gebruikers, onbeperkte werknemers, 100 KI-krediete en 2 GB berging. Geen kredietkaart is nodig om te begin nie."

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:39
msgid "What happens when the trial ends?"
msgstr "Wat gebeur wanneer die proeftydperk eindig?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:39
msgid ""
"You choose a paid plan to continue. All the data you created during the "
"trial stays intact when you upgrade."
msgstr "Jy kies 'n betaalde plan om voort te gaan. Al die data wat jy tydens die proeftydperk geskep het, bly ongeskonde wanneer jy opgradeer."

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:41
#| msgid "Cancelled"
msgid "Cancellation"
msgstr "Kansellasie"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:42
msgid "Can I cancel any time?"
msgstr "Kan ek enige tyd kanselleer?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:42
msgid ""
"Yes. You can cancel from your billing page. Access continues until the end "
"of your current billing period, and your data is preserved."
msgstr "Ja. Jy kan van jou faktureringsbladsy af kanselleer. Toegang duur voort tot die einde van jou huidige faktureringsperiode, en jou data word bewaar."

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:44
#| msgid "Operations"
msgid "Migration"
msgstr "Migrasie"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:45
msgid "Can you help me move my existing data across?"
msgstr "Kan julle my help om my bestaande data oor te skuif?"

#: apps/marketing/templates/marketing/faq.html:45
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Yes. You can import historical quotations and supplier invoices to seed your "
"history, and our team can help you get set up — <a "
"href=\"%(contact_url)s\">get in touch</a>."
msgstr "Ja. Jy kan historiese kwotasies en verskafferfakture invoer om jou geskiedenis te saai, en ons span kan jou help om op te stel — <a href=\"%(contact_url)s\">kontak ons</a>."

